{"id":"773203db9274c753","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PresRepeatRow.md","title":"PresRepeatRow","display":"PresRepeatRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"PresRepeatRow","parameters":["vx","z4681","z4682","z4683"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"PresRepeatRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>vx</span><span>z4681</span><span>z4682</span><span>z4683</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：对象理论公理代码。有序参数：<code>vx</code>、<code>z4681</code>、<code>z4682</code>、<code>z4683</code>。</p>\n<p>只用 zero/add 构造 m 次加法项，不引入对象乘法。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ PresRepeatRow vx z4681 z4682 z4683)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists m\n  (exists t\n    (and\n      (@ Pair m t z4683)\n      (and\n        (@ Nat m)\n        (and\n          (@ Nat vx)\n          (or\n            (and\n              (@ Num0 m)\n              (exists z4688\n                (exists z4689\n                  (exists z4690\n                    (and (@ Num0 z4688) (and (@ Num0 z4690) (and (@ Seq z4689 z4690) (@ FFun z4688 z4689 t))))))))\n            (exists z4686\n              (exists z4687\n                (and\n                  (@ Succ z4686 m)\n                  (and\n                    (exists z4691\n                      (exists z4692 (and (in z4691 z4682) (and (@ App z4681 z4691 z4692) (@ Pair z4686 z4687 z4692)))))\n                    (exists z4693\n                      (exists z4694\n                        (exists z4695\n                          (exists z4696\n                            (exists z4697\n                            (exists z4698\n                            (exists z4699\n                            (and\n                            (@ Num2 z4693)\n                            (and\n                            (@ Num2 z4695)\n                            (and\n                            (@ Seq z4694 z4695)\n                            (and\n                            (= z4687 z4696)\n                            (and\n                            (@ Num0 z4698)\n                            (and\n                            (@ App z4694 z4698 z4696)\n                            (and\n                            (exists z4700 (and (= vx z4700) (@ FVar z4700 z4697)))\n                            (and (@ Num1 z4699) (and (@ App z4694 z4699 z4697) (@ FFun z4693 z4694 t)))))))))))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"140c6359fed2eb8a\" href=\"?note=140c6359fed2eb8a\" title=\"ZFC_FFun\">FFun</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e67edc6c28bf5962\" href=\"?note=e67edc6c28bf5962\" title=\"ZFC_FVar\">FVar</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e8cec2782b4668b5\" href=\"?note=e8cec2782b4668b5\" title=\"ZFC_Num0\">Num0</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6abf464803506304\" href=\"?note=6abf464803506304\" title=\"ZFC_Num1\">Num1</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36fc33b3a64f5aa9\" href=\"?note=36fc33b3a64f5aa9\" title=\"ZFC_Num2\">Num2</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"ae1f2bbc